{"version":1,"content":"<p>10月26日，<strong>據彭博社報道，Anthropic周一向美國證券交易委員會提交了首次公開招股(IPO)申請，距離成為首家以開發最先進AI模型為主要業務的上市公司又近了一步</strong>。根據Anthropic提交的S-1文件，該公司預計將在納斯達克全球精選市場開始交易，股票代碼為「ANT」。Anthropic已於6月秘密提交了上市申請。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583944.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T15:21:09.780950+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":167,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T15:11:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T15:18:16.060154+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T15:18:16.060154+00:00","content_hash":"294542a6c0c668c53ab224b5b69b7593eb7c7c0460946c19a3313c3083542ffb","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}